        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ea60ed18da674a738f566477d35a0f21",
      "statement": "The router is tested in-process in tests/test_server.py via a two_agents fixture calling handle_message directly: the full handshake to friendship, task acceptance with a granted permission, the FRIEND_NOT_FOUND / PERMISSION_DENIED / RATE_LIMITED rejections, BAD_SIGNATURE for tampered, unknown-sender and fake-bootstrap-key envelopes, NONCE_REPLAY and CLOCK_SKEW, and a well-known manifest asserting no 'private' text; test_http_layer_end_to_end additionally runs the real ThreadingHTTPServer on an ephemeral port for /health plus a hello exchange over HTTP, and tests/test_client.py wires MemoryTransport delivering into server_b.handle_message.",
